   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"5\">\n  <li>Tickets to the museum cost $4.50 for children and $9.00 for adults. The equation <span data-math=\"63 = 4.5c + 9a\">63 = 4.5c + 9a</span> represents the total cost for <span data-math=\"c\">c</span> children’s tickets and <span data-math=\"a\">a</span> adult tickets. How many children’s tickets were sold if 4 adult tickets were sold?</li>\n</ol>",
